# Hollowmurk Siege, Abzan: "Whenever you attack, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature. It gains menace until end
# of turn." Bot1 has an Ornithopter and a Llanowar Elves; on turn 3 only the Ornithopter attacks: it gets the counter and
# menace (Flying; Menace) through that turn, the Elves nothing, and menace is gone on turn 4 with the counter kept. The
# Siege's Sultai ability draws nothing here: the counter put by the Abzan trigger on the Ornithopter does not draw.

